            <ArticleTitle>Abdominal wall endometriosis: sonographic diagnosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>166-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Abdominal wall endometriosis (AWE) often occurs in the surgical scar of a previous Caesarean section. In females with unexplained lower abdominal and pelvic pain who have had a C-section, the abdominal wall should be carefully examined to rule out AWE.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
